      "content": "that's a good start, the angle on sustainability and second-hand marketplaces is definitely what we're looking for. \n\ncan you expand on this? i want a full draft of the report. maybe dive deeper into how these big groups like LVMH or Chanel are reacting to the 'quiet luxury' trend compared to the more experimental stuff from Balenciaga or Gucci. \n\njust a reminder, keep the focus on the actual market analysis—the SEO score is just a secondary metric for the tech team, so don't let it distract you from making this a professional, high-quality piece for our readers.",
